organisers or the old age home.&lt;br/&gt;h) To promote free plantation and environmental awareness among the People.&lt;br/&gt;i) To help the common people for sanitary Latrine, Urinal &amp;amp; Sanitary Mart. Without profit motive.&lt;br/&gt;j) To acquire, establish, start aid, run, maintain or manage primary &amp;amp; Primary School, Libraries for the benefit of the public. Without profit motive.&lt;br/&gt;k) To open shelters or houses for orphans for their refuge with the sole purpose of charity and without any motive of earning.&lt;br/&gt;1) To arrange and Organised various sports, Game &amp;amp; Athletes.&lt;br/&gt;m) To run various Health &amp;amp; Hygienic awareness training for, the up gradation of rural people.&lt;br/&gt;n) To do all such, other things as may be deemed incidental or conductive to the attainment of&lt;br/&gt;the foregoing objects.&lt;br/&gt;o) To do all social welfare and rural development activates including sanitation, community health, road development and to adopt all sorts of schemes for the welfare of the children&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- end divider --&gt;&lt;!-- start feature --&gt;&lt;!-- end feature --&gt;&lt;!-- start feature1 --&gt;&lt;!-- end feature1 --&gt;&lt;!-- start pricing --&gt;&lt;!-- end pricing --&gt;&lt;!-- start download --&gt;&lt;!-- end download --&gt;&lt;!-- start contact --&gt;&lt;section id=&quot;contact&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;!-- end contact --&gt;', 7, '1', '2023-10-31 05:52:08', '2023-10-31 10:37:07'),
