h, two highly professionals from Real Estate Industries. The company was formed in 2018 to cater service to Real Estate Industries needs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;section id=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i6h30q&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Our Projects&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ips5&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.3s&quot; id=&quot;ivp4&quot; class=&quot;col-md-4 wow fadeInUp templatemo-box animated&quot;&gt;&lt;img draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://builder.webfire.in/public/temp/1/h6.jpg&quot; id=&quot;iavja&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot;&gt;RESPONSIVE LAYOUT&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.3s&quot; id=&quot;i23xv&quot; class=&quot;col-md-4 wow fadeInUp templatemo-box animated&quot;&gt;&lt;img id=&quot;iu3f9i&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://builder.webfire.in/public/temp/1/h5.jpg&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot;&gt;BOOTSTRAP 3.3.4&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.3s&quot; id=&quot;ix5k1&quot; class=&quot;col-md-4 wow fadeInUp templatemo-box animated&quot;&gt;&lt;img draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://builder.webfire.in/public/temp/1/h4.jpg&quot; id=&quot;iyo8k&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot;&gt;GOOGLE FONT&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i16yd&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.3s&quot; id=&quot;ibo9j&quot; class=&quot;col-md-4 wow fadeInUp templatemo-box animated&quot;&gt;&lt;img draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://builder.webfire.in/public/temp/1/h3.jpg&quot; id=&quot;i3491&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot; id=&quot;ifutf&quot;&gt;RESPONSIVE LAYOUT&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.3s&quot; id=&quot;iihp