rap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://itechgurusolution.com/public/theme/tech/assets/images/preview/mitech-landing-case-study-preview.webp&quot; height=&quot;709&quot; width=&quot;811&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot;&gt;09+ Technological&lt;/span&gt; Case Study Layouts&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;In general, analyses of famous case studies help your clients, partners, and visitors have a better understanding of what is going on in the market. Your helpful advice can also be beneficial for audiences, which keeps them coming back for more. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;case-studies.html&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md&quot;&gt;Find out more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap layout-section-bg section-space--pt_120 section-space--pb_120&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot;&gt;07+ Beautifulg&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br/&gt; Header Styles&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;Alternating between a number of diverse headers helps your pages stay dynamic and refreshing to readers. Organizing your menu items with these headers to make things more accessible for readers and reduce the bounce rate.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;blog-list-large-image.html&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md&quot;&gt;Find out more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-left mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://itechgurusolution.com/public/theme/tech/assets/images/preview/mitech-landing-header-preview-image.webp&quot; width=&quot;726&quot; height=&quot;435&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ilrjgl&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://itechgurusolution.com/public/theme/tech/assets/images/preview/mitech-landing-blog-preview.webp&quot; width=&quot;950&quot; height=&quot;782&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot;&gt;04+ Blog&lt;/span&gt; for Media News &amp;amp; Social Events&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;Blog sidebar widgets from Mitech come with an attention-grabbing feature image that can be configured from Customize menu. Choose a suitable layout for displaying images and craft valuable pieces of writing tu publish on your site.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;blog-list-large-image.html&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md&quot;&gt;Find out more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap layout-section-bg section-space--pt_80&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ht-box-icon preview-style&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;icon-box-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;image&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://itechgurusolution.com/public/theme/tech/assets/images/preview/mitech-landing-plugin-slider-86x86.webp&quot; width=&quot;86&quot; height=&quot;86&quot; alt=&quot;images-01&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Swiper Slider &lt;/h5&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text mt-10&quot;&gt;Generate unlimited full-width HD retina ready sliders with effects&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ht-box-icon preview-style&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;icon-box-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;image&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://itechgurusolution.com/public/theme/tech/assets/images/preview/mitech-landing-plugin-font-awesome-86x86.webp&quot; width=&quot;86&quot; height=&quot;86&quot; alt=&quot;images-01&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Font Awesome 5 Free &lt;/h5&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text mt-10&quot;&gt;Professional fonts and icons help improve readability &amp;amp; visual.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-left&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://itechgurusolution.com/public/theme/tech/assets/images/preview/mitech-landi