-left item-st-default&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ct-item--inner&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-css=&quot;\n                                                                           &quot; class=&quot;ct-inline-css&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 data-wow-delay=&quot;ms&quot; id=&quot;i4jy8l&quot; class=&quot;item--title st-default case-animate-time&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iy25l5&quot; class=&quot;sp-main&quot;&gt; Welcome to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-wow-delay=&quot;ms&quot; id=&quot;ip8jp2g&quot; class=&quot;item--title st-default case-animate-time&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i7ngmgh&quot; class=&quot;sp-main&quot;&gt; Tanvi Helping Group (NGO for Education) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ifvfwax&quot;&gt;The goal of Tanvi Helping Group, an NGO for education in India, is to provide quality education for children of disadvantaged communities and make a difference in the lives of those children. A vital part of their initiative is addressing the challenges that prevent these children from obtaining a quality education in their communities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;3c3b806&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;ct_text_editor.default&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-3c3b806 elementor-widget elementor-widget-ct_text_editor&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;idsnja&quot; class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;d60c980&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;ct_list.default&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-d60c980 elementor-widget elementor-widget-ct_list&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ct-list style5&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;ms&quot; class=&quot;ct-list-item wow fadeInUp&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ct-list-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fac fac-check-circle&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&q