(198, 342, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}.row{display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:stretch;flex-wrap:nowrap;padding:10px;}.cell{min-height:75px;flex-grow:1;flex-basis:100%;}#ipjak{background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:right center;background-attachment:scroll;background-size:cover;background-image:url(&#039;https://tanvihelpinggroup.in/public/temp/27/about-post.jpg&#039;);height:500px;width:100%;}#iftg{color:black;font-family:Georgia, serif;font-size:18px;margin:10px 5px 10px 5px;}#ithu{font-size:18px;font-family:Georgia, serif;color:black;margin:0px 5px 0px 5px;}#ihf7{font-size:20px;font-family:Georgia, serif;color:#00611d;margin:0px 5px 0px 5px;}@media (max-width: 992px){#ipjak{height:347px;}#ithu{margin:0px 5px 0px 5px;}#iftg{margin:0px 5px 0px 5px;}}@media (max-width: 768px){.row{flex-wrap:wrap;}}@media (max-width: 480px){#igkxj{background-repeat:repeat;background-position:left top;background-attachment:scroll;background-size:auto;background-image:none;}#ipjak{background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:left top;background-attachment:scroll;background-size:cover;background-image:url(&#039;https://tanvihelpinggroup.in/public/temp/27/about-post.jpg&#039;);height:150px;}#iftg{margin:0px 5px 0px 5px;}#ith78{margin:0px 5px 0px 5px;}#ithu{margin:0px 5px 0px 5px;}}', '&lt;body id=&quot;icef&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ipjak&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;igkxj&quot; class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ihf7&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;ith78&quot;&gt;About DR. Daga Consultancy &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-inner&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ct-page-content content-container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iftg&quot;&gt;This highly renowned institute focuses on the all-round holistic development of the children studying in 10 +2  class in various schools in districts of  Rajasthan state  who are about to enter college education. We provides career guidance to the students through psychometric examination by renowned career counselors. Students are motivated to do good courses to earn a good living, arrangements are done so as to enable them to get admission in good colleges and after completing their studies, they get employment in reputed companies. Here we make every effort to ensure excellent job at a good position in companies of national and international repute. Today children do not know about good career options, hence every year they are made aware by giving career prompts in 1000 schools and after that the institute makes the students aware again by calling them with a request  to meet with their parents and take psychometric test. The best career option is selected .Also we take job  guarantee provided that the student acquires knowledge in the true sense and in the best way. The institute also organizes free personality development and French language teaching classes for the students taking admission in the college. We also focus on studies of deprived students at lowest possible fees. Our ultimate objective is to make everyone professional and participate in the development of the state and the country.\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ithu&quot;&gt;This institution is an innovative career-tech company with a decade of experience providing career guidance and upskilling programs for individuals who foster career development. It handholds students from their first psychometric assessments to the point they choose a career for themselves and land a job. It has tie-ups with 200+ universities and  colleges and 200+ corporates. Dr ashutosh daga has a  vision to engrave youths’ career journeys, this institution has counselled more than five lakh students. The institution has a high level of reliability and credibility in its field of career counselling. Accredited and recognised by national and international psychological bodies, the institution is truly the best career counselling and job arrangement in rajasthan\n&lt;/p&gt;', 28, '1', '2024-03-28 05:45:24', '2024-03-30 06:44:44'),
(207, 355, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}#ivxaok{background-repeat:repeat;background-position:left top;background-attachment:scroll;background-size:auto;background-image:none;}#iuphu{height:300px;width:100%;}.row{display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:stretch;flex-wrap:nowrap;padding:10px;}@media (max-width: 768px){.row{flex-wrap:wrap;}}', '&lt;section id=&quot;home&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;!-- end home --&gt;&lt;!-- start divider --&gt;&lt;!-- end divider --&gt;&lt;!-- start feature --&gt;&lt;!-- end feature --&gt;&lt;!-- start feature1 --&gt;&lt;!-- end feature1 --&gt;&lt;!-- start pricing --&gt;&lt;!-- end pricing --&gt;&lt;!-- start download --&gt;&lt;!-- end download --&gt;&lt;!-- start contact --&gt;&lt;section id=&quot;contact&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;overlay&quot; id=&quot;ivxaok&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInUp&quot; id=&quot;ibrnox&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot;&gt;Contact Us&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;address&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i2kw3b&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fa fa-map-marker&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Kumbha nagar, in front of lalkar office housing board Chittorgarh 312001&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ic8gf&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fa fa-map-marker&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Devi nagar, new sanganer road Jaipur 302019&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iltx1i&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fa fa-phone&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;8003165813&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i02lal&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fa fa-envelope-o&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;daga.ashutosh5090@gmail.com&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/address&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInUp&quot; id=&quot;iv28s&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot; id=&quot;ipgjc&quot;&gt;Location&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;iframe frameborder=&quot;0&quot; src=&quot;https://maps.google.com/maps?&amp;q=Kumbha nagar, in front of lalkar office housing board Chittorgarh 312001&amp;z=11&amp;t=w&amp;output=embed&quot; class=&quot;gjs-no-pointer&quot; id=&quot;iuphu&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;!-- end contact --&gt;', 28, '1', '2024-03-30 06:51:12', '2024-03-30 06:53:29'),
(208, 354, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}.row{display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:stretch;flex-wrap:nowrap;padding:10px;}.cell{min-height:75px;flex-grow:1;flex-basis:100%;}#im687h{background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:left top;background-attachment:scroll;background-size:cover;background-image:url(&#039;https://www.dialmyca.in/images/services.jpg&#039;);width:100%;height:500px;}#i2u9p{color:black;font-family:Georgia, serif;}#iamf9{width:100%;height:100%;}#imqon{color:#056f32;}#iik3t{color:#00783d;}#im8lz{font-family:Georgia, serif;}#idtb5{color:#056f32;}#is0as{color:black;font-family:Georgia, serif;}#ioh6h{width:100%;height:100%;}#iudr2{width:100%;height:100%;}@media (max-width: 992px){#im687h{height:300px;}#iamf9{height:250px;width:1200px;}#ioh6h{width:1500px;height:300px;}#iudr2{width:1500px;height:300px;}}@media (max-width: 768px){.row{flex-wrap:wrap;}}@media (max-width: 480px){#im687h{height:200px;}}', '&lt;section id=&quot;home&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;!-- end home --&gt;&lt;!-- start divider --&gt;&lt;!-- end divider --&gt;&lt;!-- start feature --&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;im687h&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;section id=&quot;feature&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot; id=&quot;iioyu&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInLeft&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot; id=&quot;imqon&quot;&gt;Our Software Features&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i2u9p&quot;&gt;Understanding an individual’s psyche is the critical first step to shaping successful careers. You have to traverse the depths and breadths of clients’ minds to help illuminate their career paths. This aspect of the career coaching job is challenging, sometimes even nerve-wracking.&lt;br/&gt;A wrong judgement on your part has the power to jeopardise someone’s future. You can’t go by your gut or personal discretion. You require a tried and tested methodology to guide you to guide others. A psychometric test helps you do just that! Here’s how.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInRight&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSV5Aiz42HI9Yq21K9FMc6N_6ABXwRh9Vp8ns-MLzFLuvVGuTyNaG7quOpnE1QE5htGSyc&amp;usqp=CAU&quot; alt=&quot;feature img&quot; id=&quot;iamf9&quot; class=&quot;img-responsive&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;!-- end feature --&gt;&lt;!-- start feature1 --&gt;&lt;section id=&quot;feature1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInUp&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.freepik.com/premium-vector/admission-open-banner-social-media-post-template_686319-280.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;feature img&quot; id=&quot;iudr2&quot; class=&quot;img-responsive&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInUp&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot; id=&quot;iik3t&quot;&gt;COLLEGE ADMISSIONS ALL OVER INDIA WITH JOB GUARANTEE&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;im8lz&quot;&gt;“It should be compulsory for all universities/central and state government departments/central and state PSUs to list their admissions/recruitment notifications on these websites. These centralised websites should allow an aspirant to create their ‘Login ID and password’, to upload educational documents, certificates, photographs, signatures and other documents for all current or future applications. These Login accounts may also be linked with the aspirants’ Aadhaar card details,” the PIL said.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;!-- end feature1 --&gt;&lt;!-- start pricing --&gt;&lt;!-- end pricing --&gt;&lt;!-- start download --&gt;&lt;!-- end download --&gt;&lt;!-- start contact --&gt;&lt;section id=&quot;ispwb&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot; id=&quot;ibajf&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInLeft&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot; id=&quot;idtb5&quot;&gt;JOB PLACEMENT&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;is0as&quot;&gt;We do have a huge team of Expert and Professional Recruiters, who work on our client&#039;s requirement and give them a Qualitative Employee. We are having vast database, professional portals &amp;amp; a huge online network reference in entire India. Our resources are well equipped on the technologies mentioned and we ensure that the productivity of our resources will be from day One.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInRight&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://2.imimg.com/data2/PL/PO/MY-3199595/job-placement-consultants-500x500.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;feature img&quot; id=&quot;ioh6h&quot; class=&quot;img-responsive&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section id=&quot;contact&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;!-- end contact --&gt;', 28, '1', '2024-03-30 06:58:05', '2024-03-30 07:12:59'),
